{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/Gameplay_Gif_Steam.gif?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/EXPLORE_AND_FIGHT.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set on a possessed, fragmenting space station, two fugitives (an underrabbit and a broken robot) must attempt the impossible and get to the source of the possession to claim their freedom and the spoils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/UNIQUE_EVERY_PLAYTHROUGH.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand painted and procedurally generated. Our bespoke system delivers a striking style and personality with millions of permutations per run. No two playthroughs will be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/Shop_and_Gun_Steam.gif?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/COLLECT_AND_MOD_YOUR_ARSENAL.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find them all, from simple blasters to kaos evoking dimension weapons, and everything in between. Catch a portal at the right time to transport to the shopkeeper's room, meet his minions and upgrade your gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/NINE_LEVELS,_NINE_BOSSES.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the nine levels has its own terrifying gatekeeper. The bosses will use unique tactics to really mess with your day. These behemoths want one thing and one thing only -  stopping you in your tracks. You'll need to use everything in your arsenal to get past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/TRAVERSE_THE_PORTAL_SYSTEM.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/Portals_Steam.gif?t=1752893215\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/AND_RACE_THE_CLOCK.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the portal system to either skip through level sections or find the shop room. Timed runs with leaderboards reward the fastest runs. Will you go for speed but miss valuable loot, or take time to power up and become unstoppable? You decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/MEET_THE_CHARACTERS.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig into the Lore, just what is going on in this Loridian Ring Hub? How long until Big Stick Enterprises arrive, and who are these survivors? The characters you meet along the way will reveal all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/Inter_Run_Upgrade_Steam.gif?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/UPGRADES,_UPGRADES,_UPGRADES.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and upgrade a slew of special abilities. Will you go for a stealth or tank build? Deploy mines and orbital drops or hack and dance your way through the run? Use the quick access radial menu to change builds on the fly. Tweak your loadout before you start, manage perks from previous runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/Artboard_1.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local and online co-op - The 2 Fugitives vs The World! Fight and explore back to back, combine resources, cover each other, you got this together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2259390?t=1752893215","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752893215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/7aba57ca34a1e8e8ee2a092d8ab9df4359be2972/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752893215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/7aba57ca34a1e8e8ee2a092d8ab9df4359be2972/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752893215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"ful