ng?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the nine levels has its own terrifying gatekeeper. The bosses will use unique tactics to really mess with your day. These behemoths want one thing and one thing only -  stopping you in your tracks. You'll need to use everything in your arsenal to get past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/TRAVERSE_THE_PORTAL_SYSTEM.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/Portals_Steam.gif?t=1752893215\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/AND_RACE_THE_CLOCK.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the portal system to either skip through level sections or find the shop room. Timed runs with leaderboards reward the fastest runs. Will you go for speed but miss valuable loot, or take time to power up and become unstoppable? You decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/MEET_THE_CHARACTERS.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dig into the Lore, just what is going on in this Loridian Ring Hub? How long until Big Stick Enterprises arrive, and who are these survivors? The characters you meet along the way will reveal all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/Inter_Run_Upgrade_Steam.gif?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/UPGRADES,_UPGRADES,_UPGRADES.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find and upgrade a slew of special abilities. Will you go for a stealth or tank build? Deploy mines and orbital drops or hack and dance your way through the run? Use the quick access radial menu to change builds on the fly. Tweak your loadout before you start, manage perks from previous runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/extras/Artboard_1.png?t=1752893215\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local and online co-op - The 2 Fugitives vs The World! Fight and explore back to back, combine resources, cover each other, you got this together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["SOUTH WESTERLY GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259390/c8d249baaa490d77a467cb80d26c51da7b5c1175/header.jpg?t=1752893215","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright South Westerly Games LTD, 2022, All rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257170926,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170926/movie480.mp4?t=1752893213","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170926/movie_max.mp4?t=1752893213"},"name":"NINE ROUNDS RAPID - Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257170926/9eb94d5242fbe5c0be88e5b960b7e1be7ca78242/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752893213","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170926/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752893213","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257170926/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752893213"}}],"name":"NINE ROUNDS RAPID